<title>UK: LIFFE coffee breaches $1,340, cocoa slide PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee breaches $1,340, cocoa slide PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Widens losses after further funds, trade selling triggers sell-stops at $1,340. Jan off $16 at $1,336.</p>
<p>COCOA - Dec slides before expiry, others off lows, Dec/March swells to 60 stg. Dec down 12 at 869 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Thinly traded. March up 20 cents at $303.90 by 1716 GMT.</p>
</text>
